-card7-supercompactness-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcSupercompactnessMeasure}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcSupercompactnessMeasure}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}supercompactness\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcSupercompactnessMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}supercompactness\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcSupercompactnessMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda,U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是超紧致性测度的参数顺序兼容谓词；右侧规范定义同时包含超滤性、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-完全性、细性与正规性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"f2438fc1d12482c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card7-supercompactness-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"f2438fc1d12482c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard7SupercompactnessMeasure}_S\\subset